# Plan-vy Intelligence OS: environment variables.
#
# The page itself needs none: it reaches Supabase through the viewer's n8n
# connector and Claude through the artifact runtime. Store credentials are
# never set here: they go through the page (Data > Shopify stores) to the
# n8n workflow "Plan-vy · Shopify-anslutning" and into Supabase Vault.
# Copy to .env only for the local scripts below; .env is git-ignored.

# -- npm run shopify:schema (contract check against a real development store)
# The store's myshopify.com address.
SHOPIFY_SHOP=
# Either an Admin API access token (custom app made in the store admin before 2026)…
SHOPIFY_ADMIN_TOKEN=
# …or a Dev Dashboard app in the same organisation as the store.
SHOPIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SHOPIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=

# -- Supabase Edge Function "intel-shopify" (set by Supabase, not by you)
# SUPABASE_URL           the project URL, used to re-dispatch long jobs
# SUPABASE_DB_URL        Postgres connection for the function (service side only)
# The shared secret between the database and the function is generated in
# the database (Vault secret "intel_fn_secret") and is never exported.
